58:45.842 --> 58:49.259
Hello, Mayor and Council. Oh no, it's not

58:49.372 --> 58:52.708
going. Okay, so I am

58:52.805 --> 58:56.113
here to present a community garden pilot program.

58:58.380 --> 59:01.726
What we're— all we're asking for tonight is if you support the

59:02.226 --> 59:06.123
idea of it, if the site that we have proposed is acceptable,

59:06.398 --> 59:09.559
and if we should keep going forward with the idea.

59:11.183 --> 59:14.367
The reason we want to do a community garden or have this is because there's

59:14.867 --> 59:18.308
a lot of residents without yard space. And it

59:18.405 --> 59:22.380
would be a way to learn and teach skills

59:22.412 --> 59:26.628
