59:26.805 --> 59:30.764
if it— if this one works. This is

59:31.264 --> 59:35.157
the proposed site, so it's over not far from here, just west of

59:35.718 --> 59:37.577
Pioneer Park. West? Yeah.

59:38.347 --> 59:42.018
And this is close up. This is what it looks like. I'm not sure exactly

59:42.050 --> 59:45.653
where in this Rectangle, it would be, but it's

59:45.686 --> 59:46.553
somewhere in this rectangle.

59:49.211 --> 59:51.475
And that's my understanding of it, at least. We would just need to have that

59:51.525 --> 59:55.033
confirmed. How it would work is

59:55.082 --> 59:58.780
we'd have five to ten raised beds approximately, and we

59:59.280 --> 01:00:02.890
would need they would have improved soil and drip irrigation. We would have a

01:00:03.390 --> 01:00:06.857
