01:14:10.674 --> 01:14:14.030
Or whatever we needed to do to make sure that we mitigate

01:14:14.530 --> 01:14:17.800
the risk if we do move forward with this in this direction. I have seen

01:14:17.816 --> 01:14:21.804
this. I have seen it be successful in cities where there are participants

01:14:21.933 --> 01:14:25.457
where that really come out. I've seen it die on the vine

01:14:25.634 --> 01:14:28.738
