01:14:28.786 --> 01:14:31.150
person. And that's the big fear.

01:14:33.113 --> 01:14:36.891
And so it's really when a collective group comes together and you have a large

01:14:37.391 --> 01:14:40.557
enough population base that it's being watched, because oftentimes

01:14:40.734 --> 01:14:43.807
if it is just a small group. Then you get the vandalism and you get

01:14:43.840 --> 01:14:48.156
people coming in. And, and, and then I,

01:14:48.269 --> 01:14:52.041
I have 8 kids and we've grown a lot of gardens and we're

01:14:52.057 --> 01:14:55.414
