done in the past, and specifically residential. This— I

02:08:20.384 --> 02:08:23.321
don't remember the parking lot, but can you go back to the— well, actually,

02:08:23.819 --> 02:08:27.125
speaking of Woodhaven, there are 3 homes that are

02:08:27.625 --> 02:08:31.443
on basically on Woodhaven, and we've cut that, uh, you know,

