there's that big C-shaped half moon so that

02:08:35.475 --> 02:08:37.992
if someone was backing out of their driveway, they could get forward and go out.

02:08:38.827 --> 02:08:42.454
Is it, uh— I don't have my stuff,

02:08:42.519 --> 02:08:46.678
but with the plat, is there room to make some

02:08:46.710 --> 02:08:50.084
kind of a cutout like that, would that address a concern? I think you

02:08:50.584 --> 02:08:53.732
just have to ask the developer that question, Mayor, because it really is dependent upon

02:08:53.780 --> 02:08:56.962
the internal, the internal construction.

