03:11:18.488 --> 03:11:22.094
is the taxing, moving that tax over and timing of who collects

03:11:22.594 --> 03:11:26.004
the tax. So right now what we've decided is that

03:11:26.036 --> 03:11:29.289
we would leave or exit

03:11:30.028 --> 03:11:33.817
UfSA July 1st, 2028.

03:11:34.925 --> 03:11:38.458
Sorry, July— January 1st, 2028. Then next year,

03:11:38.490 --> 03:11:42.054
so 2027 budget year, just like this year, one year from what we just did,

03:11:42.552 --> 03:11:46.149
we would do the Truth in Taxation process to— Establish the rate.

03:11:46.261 --> 03:11:50.661
Establish the rate so that if for some reason we have

03:11:51.161 --> 03:11:55.172
issues, then we couldn't get out because of the that

03:11:55.672 --> 03:11:58.849
people want UFSA to keep charging too much, because that's still possible.

03:11:59.572 --> 03:12:03.281
And otherwise, we'll be able to pull it in and people will see the wisdom

03:12:03.781 --> 03:12:06.781
in that. If it passes, then we can exit. If we exit too early,

03:12:07.215 --> 03:12:10.860
then nobody's taxing at all. And we still want fire coverage, right?

03:12:10.908 --> 03:12:14.874
Yeah, we still want to. So, and I'm gonna— I think that

03:12:14.906 --> 03:12:18.551
was the layman's term of saying the timing of how that works. And if

03:12:18.615 --> 03:12:21.630
